                                <span class="fw-semibold text-dark">Michael Brown</span>
                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td><span class="tag-service-online"><i class="bi bi-camera-video me-1"></i>Online Consultation</span></td>
                        <td class="text-muted small">60 mins</td>
