        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px; background: #f8fafc;">
            <div style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase;">Treatment Packages</div>
